# The map of which file holds what: made in your own folder (herdr-wingman docs), never committed.
docs/where-things-live.md
# Superpowers plans and specs are reports: they stay outside the repo (docs/superpowers.md). The hook in .githooks
# keeps them out of a commit too; .superpowers/ is SDD's own workspace.
/docs/superpowers/
/.superpowers/
/target/
/examples/
# The program bin/run.sh downloads for this platform, with its version and its download lock.
/bin/herdr-wingman-*
/bin/.herdr-projects-*
